# Normalizes line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout, so
# editing a file that still has old Windows CRLF endings doesn't turn every
# line of it into a diff the next time it's touched (this already happened
# to index.html). Does not rewrite existing history -- only affects files
# as they're re-checked-out or re-committed from here on.
* text=auto eol=lf
